  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.0 - Specification Compliance Release (BREAKING CHANGES):\n\n      CRITICAL FIX - Communications API Paths:\n      - Fixed all RFQ/Quote endpoints to use /communications/* instead of /portfolio/*\n      - This resolves 404 errors in all RFQ/Quote operations\n\n      New Features:\n      - Added 5 missing endpoints (Communications ID, Quote Confirm, 3 MVE Collection endpoints)\n      - Added missing query parameters (time filters for Orders/Markets, filters for Collections)\n      - Added series_ticker field to IncentiveProgram (October 2025 spec update)\n\n      Coverage: 75 endpoints (100% of documented API)\n\n      See CHANGELOG.md for migration guide.",
